    {
      "t": "tip",
      "title": "Truco: am, is, are",
      "title_en": "Am, is, are trick",
      "es": "Recítalo como una canción: <b>I am, you are, he is, she is, it is, we are, they are</b>. <b>Am</b> es solo para <b>I</b>. <b>Uno solo</b> (he, she, it, Mario, my dog) → <b>is</b>. <b>Varios</b>, o <b>you</b> → <b>are</b>.",
